            "notes": "**Decision**\nAre you the hardest countered? Does the map favour fly?\n\nThe Hardest of Hard Countered means that you literally can't swing, think:\n[Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85)[Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0)[Pharah](hero_0baf7420-ff13-4b92-81f7-ca21b61dacf9)\n\nIf you lost R1, you're not running a 'Brawl' Comp and Swinging is Impossible, then go [Gryphon Glider](item_9dbd1ba2-b555-450a-8a62-5e33b45c8df6)\n\nTaking [Gryphon Glider](item_9dbd1ba2-b555-450a-8a62-5e33b45c8df6) is strictly worse than continuing to AD/Brawl/Trad Rein, you don't have the AP or CDR to be effective. \n\nDoes the map favour fly?\nIf there's a fly rollout, if the enemy comp are pinnable, you can fly here, but you'll have to kite and you'll have to play to disrupt. \n\n**Swing**\nMove Speed is superior here\n[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)\n[Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418)\n[Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054)\nAre clear winners.\n\n[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) favours Attack Speed, so [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) > [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)",
