            "notes": "**Decision**\nCan we swing?\n\n- [x] They have ground heroes\n- [x] Our Comp want to go in\n\nIf Yes, [Dampener Grip](item_451f8c81-1821-48a4-a980-ae1cebd61a85)\nElse, AP AP AP AP AP\n\nIdeally, we can swing [Dampener Grip](item_451f8c81-1821-48a4-a980-ae1cebd61a85) is very powerful early on as we get a bit of AP and if we can swing we get a lot of CDR.\n\nItem Priority follows:\nAP\nCDR\n\nTherefore, [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) & [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) are prio.",
